{
  "profile": "high",
  "label": "高配",
  "description": "适合 32 GB 以上系统内存和中高端独显；保留较远视距并允许无限 FPS。",
  "hardware": {
    "systemRamGb": "32+",
    "gpuVramGb": "8+",
    "cpu": "8 cores or more"
  },
  "memory": {
    "minMemAllocMb": 6144,
    "maxMemAllocMb": 12288
  },
  "options": {
    "renderDistance": 10,
    "simulationDistance": 8,
    "maxFps": 260,
    "graphicsMode": 1,
    "renderClouds": false,
    "entityShadows": false,
    "particles": 0,
    "entityDistanceScaling": 1.0,
    "mipmapLevels": 4,
    "biomeBlendRadius": 2
  },
  "iris": {
    "enableShaders": false
  },
  "notes": [
    "maxFps=260 是 Minecraft 的无限制档位；如果显卡持续满载，可手动改成显示器刷新率附近的值。",
    "光影主要取决于 GPU 和显存，不会因为系统内存足够而自动启用。",
    "高档也不建议默认启用 Ultra 光影或把 Java 堆提高到 16 GB。"
  ]
}
